215	    /**
216	     * The owner's derived identity key: the single value all duplicate detection is expressed
217	     * through. It is {@code normalizedTelephone + '|' + (email or empty) + '|' + (householdId or
218	     * empty)} computed from the already-normalized stored fields. Two owners are duplicates only
219	     * when their whole identity keys are equal; in particular two members of the same household
220	     * (same {@code householdId}) with different telephones have different identity keys. Not
221	     * persisted: it is derived on demand from the identity-bearing fields.
222	     */
223	    @Transient
